      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":833.0,"y":269.0},"guid":"d6acf602-e108-42dd-b5ee-0d2388fa72eb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"3509"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"PlayerHuman","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":1585.0,"y":992.0},"guid":"6ce4ee05-6c92-4d98-82ab-fabf84f8c062","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":583.0,"y":271.0},"guid":"292374a0-066a-4322-ba68-cf3f455d1f68","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"6810"},{"dictionary":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":2208.0,"y":688.0},"guid":"e85d7669-be85-42f3-86b3-aa06b608ecaa","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ForEach","$id":"6812"},{"member":{"name":"currentTrumpColor","parameterTypes":null,"targetType":"DeckManager","targetTypeName":"DeckManager","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null},"position":{"x":1460.0,"y":789.0},"guid":"5479e2ec-48d7-4908-8dd3-a99ae4d0e651","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetMember","$id":"6814"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":902.0,"y":-240.0},"guid":"1d8d3a14-9787-4891-a4f3-bca3eb9021bc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"6817"},{"member":{"name":"cardsInHand","parameterTypes":null,"targetType":"HandManager","targetTypeName":"HandManager","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null},"position":{"x":2519.0,"y":788.0},"guid":"d5267a43-9928-4848-9240-e46e8ffcc06b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetMember","$id":"6819"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Players","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":2034.0,"y":773.0},"guid":"76189802-aea5-4a87-902b-